; web.lab. authoritative zone for Lab 41 (DNS round-robin).
; The single name web.lab. resolves to three A records; with `rrset-order
; cyclic` the server rotates their order every response, so successive clients
; get a different address first — a simple, resolver-side load spread.
;
; 203.0.113.0/24 is RFC 5737 documentation space. Lab use only.
$TTL 3600
web.lab.        IN  SOA ns.web.lab. admin.web.lab. (
                    1          ; serial
                    3600       ; refresh
                    900        ; retry
                    604800     ; expire
                    300 )      ; negative cache TTL
web.lab.        IN  NS  ns.web.lab.
ns.web.lab.     IN  A   10.0.0.2

; One name, three backends. Short TTL so clients re-query and re-spread.
web.lab.        30  IN  A   203.0.113.11
web.lab.        30  IN  A   203.0.113.12
web.lab.        30  IN  A   203.0.113.13
